Method Path Auth Description <code>GET</code> <code>/api/v0/mobile/household/{household_id}/settings</code> Any household member Returns current values of all household-controllable settings <code>PUT</code> <code>/api/v0/mobile/household/{household_id}/settings/{key}</code> Household admin Sets one household-controllable setting <p>PUT request body:</p> <pre><code>{ "value": true }
</code></pre> <p>PUT response (200):</p> <pre><code>{ "success": true, "key": "web_search.enabled", "value": true }
</code></pre> <p>Values fall back to the code default when no override row exists in the DB — no seed data is required for new households.</p>
